        <mxCell id="0gBvA5zlPccnvj9Yevd9-66" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;rotation=-5;" value="Step 1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="130" y="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0gBvA5zlPccnvj9Yevd9-67" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;rotation=-5;" value="Step 2" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="130" y="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0gBvA5zlPccnvj9Yevd9-68" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;rotation=-5;" value="Step 3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="140" y="1200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0gBvA5zlPccnvj9Yevd9-69" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;rotation=-5;" value="Step 4" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="130" y="1850" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0gBvA5zlPccnvj9Yevd9-70" parent="1" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=left;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="6. Identify Technical Implementations" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="120" x="350" y="2420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0gBvA5zlPccnvj9Yevd9-71" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;rotation=-5;" value="Step 6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="150" y="2440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0gBvA5zlPccnvj9Yevd9-72" parent="1" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=left;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="- if we use 7 characters, we have an option of 62 to the power of 7 unique URL&#39;s - 3.5 Trillion&lt;br&gt;- Even if we consumed 1000 keys a second, it would take 111 years to run out" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="170" x="350" y="2510" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0gBvA5zlPccnvj9Yevd9-73" parent="1" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=left;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;How to encode the string?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Use a MD5 or SHA256 encryption algorithm and then encode using base 62&lt;br&gt;- MD5(Long URL) - &amp;gt; base62 encoding(128 bit hash value) -&amp;gt; ABCJS1234890...&lt;br&gt;- can limit it by only using first 7 characters, but if you see closely this can lead to hash collisions or key duplications&lt;br&gt;- a putIfAbsent method could do the trick, but not all noSQL DB supports it&lt;br&gt;- To avoid duplicates, may be we can have a counter from 0 to 3.5 trillion and base encode this counter and give result&lt;br&gt;- However, it is a single point of failure if the ocunter service fails and if request spikes, it may not be able to handle it&lt;br&gt;and we are not encoding the URL&lt;br&gt;- To avoid the above problem, we can leverage a Zookeeper solution , which is a distributed systems manager which gives back servers unused ranges&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Have multiple instances of ZooKeeper to avoid single point of failure&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Scaling is easy as adding a new server will give them unused ranges&lt;br&gt;- This can get all predictable for any hacker to hack the generated URL&#39;s. To make it further secure lets add random 10-15bits after the counter number from zookeeper to increase entropy" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="265" x="350" y="2760" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0gBvA5zlPccnvj9Yevd9-74" parent="1" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=left;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="6. Think do we need Load Balancer?" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="120" x="340" y="2100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0gBvA5zlPccnvj9Yevd9-75" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;rotation=-5;" value="Step 5" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="120" x="140" y="2120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0gBvA5zlPccnvj9Yevd9-76" parent="1" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=left;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="- a LB could distribute traffic&lt;br&gt;- best methods would be Least Connection, Least Response, Least Bandwidth" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="170" x="340" y="2180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="0gBvA5zlPccnvj9Yevd9-77" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;rotation=-5;" value="Step 7" vertex="1">
